    "note": {
      "en": "The paper evaluates metric predictions without GT alignment over [0,75] m. Both DAP and PaGeR have separate indoor/outdoor heads. The paper forces the domain per dataset; its numbers do not establish the accuracy of the later automatic CLIP router or superiority on a different evaluation protocol.",
      "zh": "论文在 [0,75] 米范围直接评测公制预测，不做真值对齐。DAP 和 PaGeR 均有独立室内/室外预测头，论文按数据集指定域；不能把这些数值视为后加 CLIP 自动路由的实测结果，也不能跨评测协议推断全面领先。"
